OL,3,GNEWSANew counselling service launches
OL,4,Afor islanders
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new volunteer-led counselling service
OL,7,Fhas been launched to support those
OL,8,Faffected by neurological illness,
OL,9,Ftrauma, grief and emotional distress.
OL,11,FThe Sophie Reid Neurological
OL,12,FAssociation Counselling Service, based
OL,13,Fin Jersey, operates remotely - allowing
OL,14,Fpeople who may struggle to attend
OL,15,Fappointments in person to access
OL,16,Fsupport.
OL,18,FIt was set up by the Sophie Reid
OL,19,FNeurological Association, with
OL,20,Ftechnology donated by Jersey Telecom
OL,21,F(JT) through its Community Giving
OL,22,FScheme.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
