OL,3,GNEWSANew counselling service launches
OL,4,Afor islanders
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe charity's founder and chair Sophie
OL,7,FReid said she was "incredibly grateful"
OL,8,Ffor the equipment and the service would
OL,9,Fgive people "somewhere to turn when
OL,10,Fthey need support".
